{"id":"n60213-1-7","stage":5,"title":"분유 · 奶粉","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60213-1-7-1","ko":"여보, 아기가 배가 고픈지 자꾸 울어요.","zh":"亲爱的，宝宝好像饿了，一直在哭呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보,","meaning":"喂，老婆，老公","explanation":"여보：喂，老婆，老公。","readings":[{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58165","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}},{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기가","audio":"/audio/26e60641381a50692ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"고픈지","meaning":"饿，饥饿","explanation":"고프다：饿，饥饿；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"고프다","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18396","senseId":"1","lemma":"고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고픈지","audio":"/audio/76cbaf8cf9110cf57960.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"울어요.","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울어요","audio":"/audio/44c1536f6cf4739abeac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7809541ae162d432","term":"여보","zh":"喂，老婆，老公","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3","entryId":"58165","definition":"夫妇之间的称谓。","pronunciation":["여보"]},{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"a55fb1c7a8a68fcb","term":"고프다","zh":"饿，饥饿","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3","entryId":"18396","definition":"肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["고프다"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e1b835cfd9843744687.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60213-1-7-2","ko":"네, 지금 아기 먹일 분유를 타고 있어요.","zh":"好的，我正在调奶粉喂宝宝。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"아기","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.m